---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Official Rules · Week Without Driving Las Vegas';
const description = 'Rules for the Week Without Driving Las Vegas giveaway, October 1 to 8, 2026.';
---

<BaseLayout {title} {description}>
  <section class="container-page page-top reading">
    <h1 class="page-title">Official Rules</h1>
    <p class="page-lede">Week Without Driving Las Vegas Giveaway · October 1–8, 2026</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-on-surface-variant">Last updated September 29, 2026</p>

    <article class="prose-doc mt-10">
      <p>
        These Official Rules govern participation in the Week Without Driving Las Vegas Giveaway. By
        entering, you agree to follow them.
      </p>

      <h2>Who runs it</h2>
      <p>
        Las Vegans for Better Transit (LVBT), a tax-exempt organization under Section 501(c)(3) of
        the Internal Revenue Code, sponsors and administers this giveaway. No purchase, donation, or
        social media post is required to enter or win.
      </p>

      <h2>Who can enter</h2>
      <p>
        You can enter if you live in Clark, Esmeralda, Lincoln, or Nye County, Nevada, and are at
        least 13 when you enter. If you are 13 to 17, ask a parent or guardian to agree to these
        rules before signing up. LVBT volunteers who review entries or run the draw cannot win.
      </p>

      <h2>When to enter</h2>
      <p>
        Entries are open each day from October 1 through October 8, 2026. A day begins at 12:00 a.m.
        and ends at 11:59 p.m. Las Vegas time. Submit your trip on the day you took it.
      </p>

      <h2>How to enter</h2>
      <p>
        Sign up once at <a href="/sign-up">lvwwd.org/sign-up</a> with your first name, email address,
        ZIP code, county, and age group. You may add your Instagram handle, but it is optional.
      </p>
      <p>
        On a day you take a trip without driving yourself, open <a href="/my-week">My week</a>,
        choose how you got around, and describe the trip. Bus, walking or rolling, biking or
        scooting, and getting a ride all count. My week needs an internet connection to submit an
        entry. You may also add a post link or screenshot. Neither is required. The separate “Was
        anything hard?” question is optional and does not replace the trip description.
      </p>
      <p>
        If your Instagram handle is saved in Your details, a post or story from that handle about a
        trip without driving and tagging @lasvegasfortransit may count for the day you posted it.
        LVBT volunteers check tags by hand. A tag from a handle that no one registered does not
        count. If you post to enter, say “Week Without Driving giveaway entry” at the start of the
        caption or on the story itself. Enter in My week if you want to make sure your trip is
        submitted.
      </p>
      <p>
        There is no mail entry. Each person gets at most one entry per day and eight entries total,
        whichever entry method they use. Sending a My week trip and tagging LVBT on the same day
        still counts once. LVBT reviews entries before the draw and removes duplicate entries and
        entries that do not describe a trip without driving.
      </p>

      <h2>Prize and drawing</h2>
      <p>
        One winner receives one 30-day RTC bus pass. There is no cash alternative. LVBT will draw
        the winner at random from eligible, reviewed entries by October 15, 2026. Each eligible
        entry has one chance, so the odds depend on the total number of eligible entries.
      </p>

      <h2>If you win</h2>
      <p>
        LVBT will contact you at the email address you used to sign up. Reply within seven days. If
        you do not reply or are ineligible, LVBT will draw another winner. If you are under 18, a
        parent or guardian must accept the prize for you. LVBT will arrange fulfillment with the
        winner and will never ask for money, passwords, or bank details to release the prize.
      </p>

      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p>
        LVBT uses your sign-up details and trip entries to run and review the giveaway, contact the
        winner, and fulfill the prize. Read the <a href="/privacy">Privacy page</a> for more about data
        use and deletion.
      </p>

      <h2>Instagram and questions</h2>
      <p>
        Instagram does not sponsor, administer, or endorse this giveaway. Questions? Email <a
          href="mailto:wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org">wwd@lasvegasfortransit.org</a
        >.
      </p>
    </article>

    <p class="mt-10">
      <a href="/giveaway" class="body-link font-semibold">&#8592; Back to the giveaway</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
